flowchart TD
    User([User Request / Operation]) --> AuthGate{JWT Present?}

    AuthGate -- No --> AnonRole[Role: anon]
    AnonRole --> PublicOps{Requested Endpoint?}
    PublicOps -- get_public_stats / organization_name_available / search_institutions --> AllowPublic[ALLOW: Public Aggregate / Availability Data]
    PublicOps -- Any transactional read or write --> DenyAnon[DENY: 401 / 403 Forbidden]

    AuthGate -- Yes --> ParseToken[Verify JWT & Load Profile]
    ParseToken --> VerificationCheck{Verification Status?}

    VerificationCheck -- pending / rejected --> UnverifiedUser[Unverified Member]
    UnverifiedUser --> UnverifiedOps{Requested Operation?}
    UnverifiedOps -- Browse catalog in tenant / View profile --> AllowUnverified[ALLOW: Read Resources in Tenant]
    UnverifiedOps -- request_booking / claim_released_slot --> DenyUnverified[DENY: not_verified Exception]

    VerificationCheck -- verified --> CheckRole{Profile Role}

    CheckRole -- member --> VerifiedMember[Verified Member<br/>verification_method: admin or domain]
    CheckRole -- institution_admin --> OrgAdmin[Organization Admin<br/>domain_proof: true or false]

    VerifiedMember --> MemberOps{Member Operation}
    MemberOps -- request_booking --> MemberRPC1[RPC: Check eligibility rules, duration & GiST overlap]
    MemberOps -- check_out_booking --> MemberRPC2[RPC: Assert approved, 15m window, QR code, SHA-256 hashes]
    MemberOps -- check_in_booking --> MemberRPC3[RPC: QR code, photos, 5-tier condition, checklist]
    MemberOps -- claim_released_slot --> MemberRPC4[RPC: Check tenant match & slot open]
    MemberOps -- Direct SQL Mutation --> DenyDirectWrite[DENY: Direct table writes revoked]

    OrgAdmin --> AdminOps{Admin Operation}
    AdminOps -- decide_booking --> AdminRPC1[RPC: Approve or reject with row lock & decision note]
    AdminOps -- admin_cancel_booking --> AdminRPC2[RPC: Revoke reservation with mandatory reason & audit log]
    AdminOps -- verify_member / qual --> AdminRPC3[RPC: Manual vetting of non-domain affiliate accounts]
    AdminOps -- inspect_return --> AdminRPC4[RPC: Side-by-side comparison & server-computed dispute outcome]
    AdminOps -- record_asset_audit --> AdminRPC5[RPC: Spot audit logging with photo hash & accessory checks]
    AdminOps -- Direct SQL Mutation --> DenyDirectWrite

    MemberRPC1 --> DBCommit[(PostgreSQL Commit)]
    MemberRPC2 --> DBCommit
    MemberRPC3 --> DBCommit
    MemberRPC4 --> DBCommit
    AdminRPC1 --> DBCommit
    AdminRPC2 --> DBCommit
    AdminRPC3 --> DBCommit
    AdminRPC4 --> DBCommit
    AdminRPC5 --> DBCommit
